  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous Rights and Management of the Rio Negro territory. Strengthening FOIRN and its Regional Organizations.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strengthening the defence of indigenous peoples&apos; tights and the management of their territories with political indigenous protagonism. It also seeks to foster tge territories sustainable development and Indigenous political incidence by applying the Rio Negro basin tradicional knowledge and non-indigenous mechanisms. Strengthen FOIRN&apos;s Regional Sub-divisions (Coordenadorias) in its five regions of operation. Finally, the project intends to foster community initiatives based on the local culture and knowledge, with a strong participation of the young and women population.</narrative>
  </description>
